#. type: Plain text
#: ../Documentation-sedout/git-am.txt:7
msgid "git-am - Apply a series of patches from a mailbox"
msgstr "git-am - メールボックスから一連のパッチを適用します"

#. type: Title -
#: ../Documentation-sedout/git-am.txt:10
#, no-wrap
msgid "SYNOPSIS"
msgstr "SYNOPSIS"

#. type: Plain text
#: ../Documentation-sedout/git-am.txt:22
#, fuzzy, no-wrap
msgid ""
"'git am' [--signoff] [--keep] [--[no-]keep-cr] [--[no-]utf8] [--no-verify]\n"
"\t [--[no-]3way] [--interactive] [--committer-date-is-author-date]\n"
"\t [--ignore-date] [--ignore-space-change | --ignore-whitespace]\n"
"\t [--whitespace=<action>] [-C<n>] [-p<n>] [--directory=<dir>]\n"
"\t [--exclude=<path>] [--include=<path>] [--reject] [-q | --quiet]\n"
"\t [--[no-]scissors] [-S[<keyid>]] [--patch-format=<format>]\n"
"\t [--quoted-cr=<action>]\n"
"\t [--empty=(stop|drop|keep)]\n"
"\t [(<mbox> | <Maildir>)...]\n"
"'git am' (--continue | --skip | --abort | --quit | --retry | --show-current-patch[=(diff|raw)] | --allow-empty)\n"
msgstr ""
"'git am' [--signoff] [--keep] [--[no-]keep-cr] [--[no-]utf8] [--no-verify]\n"
"\t [--[no-]3way] [--interactive] [--committer-date-is-author-date]\n"
"\t [--ignore-date] [--ignore-space-change | --ignore-whitespace]\n"
"\t [--whitespace=<action>] [-C<n>] [-p<n>] [--directory=<dir>]\n"
"\t [--exclude=<path>] [--include=<path>] [--reject] [-q | --quiet]\n"
"\t [--[no-]scissors] [-S[<keyid>]] [--patch-format=<format>]\n"
"\t [--quoted-cr=<action>]\n"
"\t [--empty=(stop|drop|keep)]\n"
"\t [(<mbox> | <Maildir>)...]\n"
"'git am' (--continue | --skip | --abort | --quit | --retry | --show-current-patch[=(diff|raw)] | --allow-empty)\n"

#. type: Title -
#: ../Documentation-sedout/git-am.txt:24
#, no-wrap
msgid "DESCRIPTION"
msgstr "DESCRIPTION"

#. type: Plain text
#: ../Documentation-sedout/git-am.txt:30
#, fuzzy
#| msgid ""
#| "Splits mail messages in a mailbox into commit log message, authorship "
#| "information and patches, and applies them to the current branch. You "
#| "could think of it as a reverse operation of linkgit:git-format-patch[1] "
#| "run on a branch with a straight history without merges."
msgid ""
"Splits mail messages in a mailbox into commit log messages, authorship "
"information, and patches, and applies them to the current branch. You could "
"think of it as a reverse operation of linkgit:git-format-patch[1] run on a "
"branch with a straight history without merges."
msgstr ""
"メールボックス内のメールメッセージを、 コミットログメッセージと作者情報とパッ"
"チに分割し、 それらを現在のブランチに適用します。 これは、 マージのない真っ直"
"ぐな履歴を持つブランチで実行される linkgit:git-format-patch[1] の逆の操作と考"
"えることができます。"

#. type: Title -
#: ../Documentation-sedout/git-am.txt:32
#, no-wrap
msgid "OPTIONS"
msgstr "OPTIONS"

#. type: Labeled list
#: ../Documentation-sedout/git-am.txt:33
#, no-wrap
msgid "(<mbox>|<Maildir>)..."
msgstr "(<mbox>|<Maildir>)..."

#. type: Plain text
#: ../Documentation-sedout/git-am.txt:37
msgid ""
"The list of mailbox files to read patches from. If you do not supply this "
"argument, the command reads from the standard input.  If you supply "
"directories, they will be treated as Maildirs."
msgstr ""
"パッチを読み取るメールボックスファイルのリスト。 この引数を指定しない場合、コ"
"マンドは標準入力から読み取ります。 ディレクトリを指定すると、それらはMaildir"
"として扱われます。"

#. type: Plain text
#: ../Documentation-sedout/git-am.txt:43
#, fuzzy, no-wrap
#| msgid "Add a `Signed-off-by` trailer to the commit message, using the committer identity of yourself.  See the signoff option in linkgit:git-commit[1] for more information."
msgid ""
"`-s::`\n"
"`--signoff::`\n"
"\tAdd a `Signed-off-by` trailer to the commit message, using\n"
"\tthe committer identity of yourself.\n"
"\tSee the signoff option in linkgit:git-commit[1] for more information.\n"
msgstr "自分のコミッターIDを使用して、コミットメッセージに `Signed-off-by` トレーラーを追加します。 詳細については、 linkgit:git-commit[1] のsignoffオプションを参照してください。"

#. type: Plain text
#: ../Documentation-sedout/git-am.txt:47
#, fuzzy, no-wrap
#| msgid "Pass `-k` flag to 'git mailinfo' (see linkgit:git-mailinfo[1])."
msgid ""
"`-k::`\n"
"`--keep::`\n"
"\tPass `-k` flag to 'git mailinfo' (see linkgit:git-mailinfo[1]).\n"
msgstr "`-k` フラグを `git mailinfo` に渡します(linkgit:git-mailinfo[1] 参照)。"

#. type: Plain text
#: ../Documentation-sedout/git-am.txt:50
#, fuzzy, no-wrap
#| msgid "Pass `-b` flag to 'git mailinfo' (see linkgit:git-mailinfo[1])."
msgid ""
"`--keep-non-patch::`\n"
"\tPass `-b` flag to 'git mailinfo' (see linkgit:git-mailinfo[1]).\n"
msgstr "`-b` フラグを `git mailinfo` に渡します(linkgit:git-mailinfo[1] 参照)。"

#. type: Plain text
#: ../Documentation-sedout/git-am.txt:56
#, fuzzy, no-wrap
#| msgid "With `--keep-cr`, call 'git mailsplit' (see linkgit:git-mailsplit[1])  with the same option, to prevent it from stripping CR at the end of lines. `am.keepcr` configuration variable can be used to specify the default behaviour.  `--no-keep-cr` is useful to override `am.keepcr`."
msgid ""
"`--[no-]keep-cr::`\n"
"\tWith `--keep-cr`, call 'git mailsplit' (see linkgit:git-mailsplit[1])\n"
"\twith the same option, to prevent it from stripping CR at the end of\n"
"\tlines. `am.keepcr` configuration variable can be used to specify the\n"
"\tdefault behaviour.  `--no-keep-cr` is useful to override `am.keepcr`.\n"
msgstr "`--keep-cr` を使用して、同じオプションで `git mailsplit` (linkgit:git-mailsplit[1] 参照)を呼び出し、行末のCRが削除されないようにします。 `am.keepcr` 構成変数を使用して、デフォルトの動作を指定できます。 `--no-keep-cr` は、 `am.keepcr` をオーバーライドするのに役立ちます。"

#. type: Plain text
#: ../Documentation-sedout/git-am.txt:62
#, fuzzy, no-wrap
#| msgid "Remove everything in body before a scissors line (see linkgit:git-mailinfo[1]). Can be activated by default using the `mailinfo.scissors` configuration variable."
msgid ""
"`-c::`\n"
"`--scissors::`\n"
"\tRemove everything in body before a scissors line (see\n"
"\tlinkgit:git-mailinfo[1]). Can be activated by default using\n"
"\tthe `mailinfo.scissors` configuration variable.\n"
msgstr "切り取り線行の前にある本体のすべてを削除します(linkgit:git-mailinfo[1] 参照)。 `mailinfo.scissors` 構成変数を使用してデフォルトでアクティブ化できます。"

#. type: Plain text
#: ../Documentation-sedout/git-am.txt:65
#, fuzzy, no-wrap
#| msgid "Ignore scissors lines (see linkgit:git-mailinfo[1])."
msgid ""
"`--no-scissors::`\n"
"\tIgnore scissors lines (see linkgit:git-mailinfo[1]).\n"
msgstr "切り取り線を無視します(linkgit:git-mailinfo[1] 参照)。"

#. type: Plain text
#: ../Documentation-sedout/git-am.txt:68
#, fuzzy, no-wrap
#| msgid "This flag will be passed down to 'git mailinfo' (see linkgit:git-mailinfo[1])."
msgid ""
"`--quoted-cr=<action>::`\n"
"\tThis flag will be passed down to 'git mailinfo' (see linkgit:git-mailinfo[1]).\n"
msgstr "このフラグは `git mailinfo` に渡されます(linkgit:git-mailinfo[1] 参照)。"

